      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Brahma volvió y anunció: —Encontré la punta del pilar. Esta flor es mi testigo.",
          "en": "Brahma came back and announced: \"I found the top of the pillar. This flower is my witness.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Vishnu, en cambio, dijo la verdad: —Yo no encontré el final.",
          "en": "Vishnu, instead, told the truth: \"I did not find the end.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "En ese momento, el pilar se abrió con un estruendo.",
          "en": "At that moment, the pillar split open with a roar."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y de adentro salió Shiva, con su tridente, su luna creciente y una serpiente en el cuello.",
          "en": "And out of it came Shiva, with his trident, his crescent moon, and a serpent around his neck."
        }
