      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Shiva lo había visto todo. Y la mentira lo enfureció.",
          "en": "Shiva had seen everything. And the lie made him furious."
        },
        {
          "es": "El Shiva Purana dice que decretó que a Brahma no se le adoraría como a los demás dioses.",
          "en": "The Shiva Purana says he decreed that Brahma would not be worshipped like the other gods."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y la flor ketaki nunca más podría ofrecérsele a Shiva.",
          "en": "And the ketaki flower could never again be offered to Shiva."
        },
        {
          "es": "A Vishnu, que dijo la verdad, lo honró como su igual.",
          "en": "Vishnu, who had told the truth, he honored as his equal."
        },
        {
          "es": "Tú, ¿le habrías perdonado la mentira a Brahma?",
          "en": "What about you: would you have forgiven Brahma for lying?"
        }
      ],
